# landmark (assets/world3d/laundry/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# The Royal Spin Cycle: a long wash house with chimneys and the copper drum on its ridge, the washing line strung in front.
# Hand-placed by the landmark pass on the room's blocked back band and what lies behind it,
# so it never stands on a tile a knight walks or hides the floor from the camera.

# the wash house, set back
box    plaster at 192 0 -10 size 220 28 28 id lm-wash-house
gable  slate   at 192 28 -10 size 230 16 32
box    brick   at 128 38 -14 size 10 22 10
box    brick   at 256 38 -14 size 10 22 10
box    door    at 192 0 4.5 size 22 22 2
# the drum: a copper tank on the ridge
cylinder-16 metal   at 192 44 -10 size 38 24 38 id lm-drum
# the washing line between two posts, the washing hung from it
cylinder-6 wood    at 36 0 10 size 4 52 4
cylinder-6 wood    at 348 0 10 size 4 52 4
box    wood    at 192 46 10 size 316 1.5 1.5 id lm-line
